 "brief": "Amnesty International's United States branch has called on countries worldwide to adopt stricter measures against Israel, demanding an immediate end to political, financial, and military support that could contribute to serious human rights violations, Shehab Wire reported.\n\nThe organization pressed governments to halt all forms of assistance that might facilitate grave abuses, citing concerns over Israel's conduct. The call represents a significant escalation in efforts to isolate Israel through international pressure on its diplomatic relationships and military capacity.",
